{"id":"c2347bd841306e40","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-fixed-point-valuation.md","title":"Unique Valuation Solving a Modalized Equation","display":"lem-fixed-point-valuation — Unique Valuation Solving a Modalized Equation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-fixed-point-valuation","aliases":["89-lem-fixed-point-valuation"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-fixed-point-valuation — Unique Valuation Solving a Modalized Equation","depends_on":["[[89-df-modalized]]","[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","[[89-df-dotted-box]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-fixed-point-valuation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-fixed-point-valuation</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fixed-point-valuation — Unique Valuation Solving a Modalized Equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"138d8c34e0370a6b\" href=\"?note=138d8c34e0370a6b\" title=\"89-df-modalized\">89-df-modalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"437e16026e9e0691\" href=\"?note=437e16026e9e0691\" title=\"89-df-finite-frame-rank\">89-df-finite-frame-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"95a48b6ae42f7e48\" href=\"?note=95a48b6ae42f7e48\" title=\"89-df-dotted-box\">89-df-dotted-box</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为有限 GL 框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_X\">\\(V_X\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\ne p\">\\(q\\ne p\\)</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(q)\">\\(V(q)\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq W\">\\(X\\subseteq W\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是字母集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 是 dotted box。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>；下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_X\">\\(V_X\\)</span> 的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists!X\\subseteq W\\;\\forall w\\in W\\;\n((W,R,V_X),w\\models p\\leftrightarrow A),\\\\\n&amp;p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\land\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow B\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists!X\\subseteq W\\;\\forall w\\in W\\;\n((W,R,V_X),w\\models p\\leftrightarrow A),\\\\\n&amp;p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\land\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow B\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_X(q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}X,&amp;q=p,\\\\V(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\\end{cases}\\quad(X\\subseteq W,\\ q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_X(q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}X,&amp;q=p,\\\\V(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\\end{cases}\\quad(X\\subseteq W,\\ q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 122（练习 1；本库展开秩归纳）；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>按有限秩从小到大赋值。每个盒子只访问更小秩；模态化使当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不依赖当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，其真值完全由已确定的低秩赋值和其他字母决定。令当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 等于该真值，即得存在性；同一秩归纳说明任何解在每个世界都必须取这个值，给唯一性。零秩世界的盒子均真，第一步也确定。\n第二式是原书第 122 页练习 1。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 不是定理，有限完全性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的反模型。依第一式调整所有世界的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 因不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 而保持假；所有世界满足方程，故根满足 dotted-box 方程，反驳所给定理。此保守性证明不使用不动点存在定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modalized","status":"resolved","id":"138d8c34e0370a6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite-frame-rank","status":"resolved","id":"437e16026e9e0691","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-box]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"V_X","display":false},{"tex":"q\\ne p","display":false},{"tex":"V(q)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"V_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}valuation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\exists!X\\subseteq W\\;\\forall w\\in W\\;\n((W,R,V_X),w\\models p\\leftrightarrow A),\\\\\n&p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\land\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow B\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V_X(q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}X,&q=p,\\\\V(q),&q\\ne p,\\end{cases}\\quad(X\\subseteq W,\\ q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":2195,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"例子与边界：[[89-ex-fixed-point-computation]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase]]、[[89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum]]、[[89-ex-godel-sentence-modal]]、[[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。练习展开：[[89-lem-fixed-point-valuation]]、[[89-thm-double-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["138d8c34e0370a6b","437e16026e9e0691","9f00301866fbd6f0","b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","0157f8bea9275cf1","95a48b6ae42f7e48"]}